sequenceDiagram
  actor Client as Browser (apps/app)
  participant App as apps/app SSE Route
  participant Runtime as AgenticRuntime

  Client->>App: GET /api/runs/:runId/events (SSE)
  Note right of App: apps/app/src/app/api/runs/[runId]/events/route.ts:12-112
  App->>Runtime: subscribe(runId, handler)
  Runtime-->>App: emit events (agent/tool/stream/META)
  App-->>Client: event: connected \n data: {type:"connected"}
  loop stream
    App-->>Client: data: {type, payload, timestamp}
  end
  alt Rate limit exceeded
    App-->>Client: 429 Too Many Requests
  else Forbidden in test env
    App-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
  else Internal error
    App-->>Client: 500
  end
